{"id":"842c1db14c45597e","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-distinct-three-sat-padding-and-completeness.md","title":"用新变量补齐三个互异文字","display":"thm-distinct-three-sat-padding-and-completeness — 用新变量补齐三个互异文字","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-distinct-three-sat-padding-and-completeness","aliases":["73-thm-distinct-three-sat-padding-and-completeness"],"display":"thm-distinct-three-sat-padding-and-completeness — 用新变量补齐三个互异文字","depends_on":["[[73-df-third-edition-distinct-three-cnf]]","[[73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat]]","[[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]","[[73-thm-three-sat-np-completeness]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.3.4, Theorem 10.15, print pp. 456–458; PDF pp. 478–480; explicit fresh-variable padding","source_status":"source-construction-checked; padding truth tables locally checked; full reduction chain stated","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-distinct-three-sat-padding-and-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-distinct-three-sat-padding-and-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-distinct-three-sat-padding-and-completeness — 用新变量补齐三个互异文字"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a885beae46be5447\" href=\"?note=a885beae46be5447\" title=\"73-df-third-edition-distinct-three-cnf\">73-df-third-edition-distinct-three-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3eb1d15e0e8f389d\" href=\"?note=3eb1d15e0e8f389d\" title=\"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat\">73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"41d5b79d11297576\" href=\"?note=41d5b79d11297576\" title=\"73-df-binary-np-completeness\">73-df-binary-np-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38822aafbdc2b135\" href=\"?note=38822aafbdc2b135\" title=\"73-thm-three-sat-np-completeness\">73-thm-three-sat-np-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.3.4, Theorem 10.15, print pp. 456–458; PDF pp. 478–480; explicit fresh-variable padding"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-construction-checked; padding truth tables locally checked; full reduction chain stated"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(P\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 为有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell,m\\in P\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in P\\}\">\\(\\ell,m\\in P\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in P\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\ne m\">\\(\\ell\\ne m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\setminus P\">\\(u,v\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\setminus P\\)</span> 为互异新变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu,\\mu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\">\\(\\nu,\\mu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\)</span>，允许改变 P 外的取值，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu{\\upharpoonright}P=\\nu{\\upharpoonright}P\">\\(\\mu{\\upharpoonright}P=\\nu{\\upharpoonright}P\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1,F_2\">\\(F_1,F_2\\)</span> 在下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_1(\\ell,u,v)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Conj}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,u,v\\rangle),\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,u,\\neg v\\rangle),\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,\\neg u,v\\rangle),\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,\\neg u,\\neg v\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_1(\\ell,u,v)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Conj}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,u,v\\rangle),\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,u,\\neg v\\rangle),\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,\\neg u,v\\rangle),\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,\\neg u,\\neg v\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_2(\\ell,m,u)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Conj}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,m,u\\rangle),\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,m,\\neg u\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_2(\\ell,m,u)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Conj}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,m,u\\rangle),\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,m,\\neg u\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\ell⟧_\\nu=1\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\;(\\mu{\\upharpoonright}P=\\nu{\\upharpoonright}P\\land ⟦ F_1(\\ell,u,v)⟧_\\mu=1),\\qquad\n⟦\\ell\\vee m⟧_\\nu=1\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\;(\\mu{\\upharpoonright}P=\\nu{\\upharpoonright}P\\land ⟦ F_2(\\ell,m,u)⟧_\\mu=1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\ell⟧_\\nu=1\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\;(\\mu{\\upharpoonright}P=\\nu{\\upharpoonright}P\\land ⟦ F_1(\\ell,u,v)⟧_\\mu=1),\\qquad\n⟦\\ell\\vee m⟧_\\nu=1\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\;(\\mu{\\upharpoonright}P=\\nu{\\upharpoonright}P\\land ⟦ F_2(\\ell,m,u)⟧_\\mu=1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NPComplete}(\\mathsf{ThreeSAT}^{\\ne}_{\\mathcal B}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NPComplete}(\\mathsf{ThreeSAT}^{\\ne}_{\\mathcal B}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>单文字为假时，u,v 的任意取值都会使四个子句之一为假；为真时四者皆真。双文字相似。整式先删重复文字、去掉含互补对的恒真子句，再为各短子句取互不重用的新变量；三个文字的子句保持不变。原本不含空子句；若从一般 CSAT 转换遇到空子句，可映到固定不可满足的八个三文字子句。两种填充已直接使用本册带 ⊥ 初始包装的 Disj、⊤ 初始包装的 Conj 构造，因而直接给出 ThreeCNF≠ 的语法对象，不再借助未声明的项结合约定或在备注中另行重组。新编号至多线性增加，现有一元变量号编码下仍为多项式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-third-edition-distinct-three-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"a885beae46be5447","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-third-edition-distinct-three-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat","status":"resolved","id":"3eb1d15e0e8f389d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"41d5b79d11297576","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-three-sat-np-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"38822aafbdc2b135","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-three-sat-np-completeness]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell,m\\in P\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in P\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell\\ne m","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\setminus P","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu,\\mu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu{\\upharpoonright}P=\\nu{\\upharpoonright}P","display":false},{"tex":"F_1,F_2","display":false},{"tex":"F_1(\\ell,u,v)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Conj}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,u,v\\rangle),\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,u,\\neg v\\rangle),\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,\\neg u,v\\rangle),\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,\\neg u,\\neg v\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right),","display":true},{"tex":"F_2(\\ell,m,u)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Conj}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,m,u\\rangle),\n\\operatorname{Disj}(\\langle\\ell,m,\\neg u\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"⟦\\ell⟧_\\nu=1\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\;(\\mu{\\upharpoonright}P=\\nu{\\upharpoonright}P\\land ⟦ F_1(\\ell,u,v)⟧_\\mu=1),\\qquad\n⟦\\ell\\vee m⟧_\\nu=1\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\;(\\mu{\\upharpoonright}P=\\nu{\\upharpoonright}P\\land ⟦ F_2(\\ell,m,u)⟧_\\mu=1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NPComplete}(\\mathsf{ThreeSAT}^{\\ne}_{\\mathcal B}).","display":true}],"bytes":2941,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-distinct-three-sat-padding-and-completeness]]"},{"id":"88dea30e48fadc7f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"此处 3-CNF 指每子句至多三文字。合取空列表表示真；单子句内部递归的初始假值只是固定语法包装，大小线性且可立即化简。第三版要求恰三个互异文字，不能靠重复文字填充；须用新变量构造，见 [[73-thm-distinct-three-sat-padding-and-completeness]]。SAT 子句使用固定有效布尔编码包 𝓑，取满足 BoolCoding 的同一实例。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-273","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-distinct-three-sat-padding-and-completeness|用新变量补齐三个互异文字]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["a885beae46be5447","3eb1d15e0e8f389d","41d5b79d11297576","38822aafbdc2b135"]}